    "stem": "Northshore Refill Co sells reusable household-cleaning bottles. Each bottle sells for £42 and has a variable cost of £27, so the contribution per bottle is £15. Fixed costs are £90,000 per year. Actual output this year is 7,500 bottles.\n\nCalculate:\n1. the break-even output\n2. the margin of safety.\n\nShow your workings.",
